==================================================================================
PARITY (web ChangelogModal.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  Data sources (web -> native P1/S8 seam):
    useTranslation              -> ChangelogStrings facade (P1/S10), no literals.
    useChangelog.entries        -> ChangelogUpdate.entries (source-owned; ChangelogCatalog ports CHANGELOG).
    useChangelog.seenVersion    -> ChangelogUpdate.seenVersion.
    useChangelog.newEntries     -> ChangelogProjection.newEntries(from:seenVersion:) (compareVersions port).
    markSeen / stampShown       -> ChangelogActions.markSeen() / stampShown().
    handleViewFull window.open  -> ChangelogActions.openFullChangelog(url:) (ChangelogSurface.releasesURL).
  Composition (web Modal/body/footer -> native):
    Modal title "What's new..."  -> header title + freshness chip + close "x".
    subtitle first-visit/since   -> model.subtitleText (welcome vs "{{count}} new release(s)").
    visibleEntries.map(Entry)    -> ScrollView of ChangelogEntryRow (collapsible).
    entry header v{version}+Badge-> v{version} mono + ChangelogReleaseBadge (BADGE_VARIANT ->
      +date+chevron                success/info/warning tone) + date + chevron.
    grouped (SECTION_ORDER)      -> model.groups(for:) -> ChangelogSectionView per category, drop-empty.
    SECTION_DOT colored dots     -> ChangelogSectionPalette (added=success, changed=accent, fixed=warning,
                                   removed/security=danger, deprecated=chart purple).
    defaultOpen={idx<2}          -> ChangelogProjection.defaultExpandedVersions (first two).
    Button ghost View full       -> TSButton(.ghost) -> viewFull (markSeen + open URL + dismiss).
    Button primary Got it        -> TSButton(.primary) -> gotIt (markSeen + dismiss).
    Esc/backdrop close           -> close (leaves seen-state untouched; throttle stamped on open).
  Tailwind classes were NOT ported; chrome is P1/S9 tokens (TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/Font.TS) + TSButton.

==================================================================================
STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
==================================================================================
  loading  -> ChangelogLoadingState (pulsing skeleton; honors Reduce Motion).
  empty    -> ChangelogEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView "No release notes yet").
  error    -> ChangelogErrorState (QueryError-equivalent + Retry -> model.refresh()).
  stale    -> freshness chip "Stale" + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh.
  offline  -> freshness chip "Offline" + banner; cached history kept; no refetch.
  populated-> the release list (+ inline reload error if a refresh failed while a cached history remains).
  Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 view.opened surface="ChangelogModal" (once, idempotent — proven).

